<title>CANADA: DBRS confirms UGG ratings, trends stable.</title>
<headline>DBRS confirms UGG ratings, trends stable.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dominion Bond Rating Service on Thursday confirmed the United Grain Growers Ltd long-term debt rating at BB (high), the preferred share rating at Pfd-4 and the commercial paper rating at R-2 (low).</p>
<p>The trend for each rating was stable.  The confirmation is based on UGG's credible performance in 1996, DBRS said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
